List component extensions through the configured API

Usage:
  eshu component inventory [flags]

Flags:
      --api-key string       API key for authentication
  -h, --help                 help for inventory
      --json                 Write the canonical component extension envelope as JSON
      --limit int            Maximum number of component rows to return (default 100)
      --profile string       Config profile name
      --service-url string   API service URL (overrides config)

Global Flags:
      --database string   Temporarily override database backend
  -V, --visual            Show results as interactive graph visualization
